An unquoted dotted path as the first argument of ExecFunction or DoProc
(diag.execfunction_missing_quotes, error, from the identifier through the
dotted fragment). dot_property_access stays silent on that fragment
(issue #255): one finding per defect.
Suspected issue: #328 — for a three-part path (Billing.Tax.Rate) the range stops after "Billing.Tax." instead of spanning the whole path, and under strict the tail "Rate" (and each leading segment, Billing/Reports) is also reported as an undeclared variable, though the catalog says the range "spans from the first-argument identifier through the dotted fragment" and the defect "reports once, here".
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE Dispatch;
	:DECLARE nOut;
	nOut := ExecFunction(Billing.ComputeFees, {1});
	nOut := DoProc(Reports.BuildSummary, {nOut});
	nOut := execfunction(Billing.Tax.Rate);
	:RETURN nOut;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:PROCEDURE Dispatch;
	:DECLARE nOut;
	nOut := ExecFunction(Billing.ComputeFees, {1});
	nOut := DoProc(Reports.BuildSummary, {nOut});
	nOut := ExecFunction(Billing.Tax.Rate);
	:RETURN nOut;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
3:23-3:42 error execfunction_missing_quotes: Namespace path must be quoted: ExecFunction("Module.Procedure", ...) not ExecFunction(Module.Procedure, ...)
4:17-4:37 error execfunction_missing_quotes: Namespace path must be quoted: DoProc("Module.Procedure", ...) not DoProc(Module.Procedure, ...)
5:23-5:35 error execfunction_missing_quotes: Namespace path must be quoted: execfunction("Module.Procedure", ...) not execfunction(Module.Procedure, ...)
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
3:23-3:42 error execfunction_missing_quotes: Namespace path must be quoted: ExecFunction("Module.Procedure", ...) not ExecFunction(Module.Procedure, ...)
3:23-3:30 warning undeclared_variable: Variable 'Billing' is not declared
4:17-4:37 error execfunction_missing_quotes: Namespace path must be quoted: DoProc("Module.Procedure", ...) not DoProc(Module.Procedure, ...)
4:17-4:24 warning undeclared_variable: Variable 'Reports' is not declared
5:23-5:35 error execfunction_missing_quotes: Namespace path must be quoted: execfunction("Module.Procedure", ...) not execfunction(Module.Procedure, ...)
5:35-5:39 warning undeclared_variable: Variable 'Rate' is not declared
